#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:340
msgid "5.2 Multi-Node Data Parallel Deployment"
msgstr "5.2 多节点数据并行部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:342
msgid ""
"`DeepSeek-V3.1-w8a8-mtp-QuaRot`: require at least 2 Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8)."
msgstr "`DeepSeek-V3.1-w8a8-mtp-QuaRot`：至少需要2台Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:344
msgid "Run the following scripts on two nodes respectively."
msgstr "分别在两个节点上运行以下脚本。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md
msgid "Node 0"
msgstr "节点0"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md
msgid "Node 1"
msgstr "节点1"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:467
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size`: total number of data parallel ranks across all "
"nodes. In this example, `4` means the model is split across 4 DP ranks total"
" (2 per node)."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size`：所有节点上的数据并行总秩数。在本示例中，`4` 表示模型被划分为总共4个DP秩（每个节点2个）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:468
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local`: number of data parallel ranks running on the "
"current node. In this example, each node runs 2 DP ranks."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-size-local`：当前节点上运行的数据并行秩数。在本示例中，每个节点运行2个DP秩。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:469
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank`: starting rank offset for data parallel ranks "
"on this node. Node 0 starts at rank 0 (default), Node 1 starts at rank 2. "
"This ensures each node's DP ranks occupy distinct positions in the overall "
"rank space."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-start-"
"rank`：当前节点上数据并行秩的起始偏移量。节点0从秩0开始（默认），节点1从秩2开始。这确保每个节点的DP秩在全局秩空间中占据不同的位置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:470
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (Node"
" 0). This value must be consistent with `local_ip` set on Node 0."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点0）的IP地址。该值必须与节点0上设置的 `local_ip` 一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:471
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-rpc-port`: RPC port for data parallel master communication."
" Must be the same across all nodes."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-rpc-port`：数据并行主节点通信的RPC端口。所有节点必须保持一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:472
msgid ""
"`--headless`: indicates that this vLLM instance is not the master service "
"node. Only set on non-master nodes (Node 1). The master node (Node 0) should"
" NOT set this flag."
msgstr "`--headless`：表示此vLLM实例不是主服务节点。仅在非主节点（节点1）上设置。主节点（节点0）不应设置此标志。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.1.md:473
